    "interpretation": "Three street positions put the entrance 7–8 m east and about 3.6 m north of the middle of the frozen parcel edge. Wayback 2026-01-29 independently shows the rectangular pale central roof front at that offset, with steep perspective occluding the western end. The photographed historic street wall extends beyond the older coarse parcel at the eastern end. The transverse cut meets only the northernmost strip of source 2541. Retain the rear body, both rear high buildings and the existing lane gate across the street."
